PLAN AKI\uc0\u350 I (2026-05-10):\
\
(1) GOOGLE TRENDS API ENTEGRASYONU (V1 zorunlu, ~1 g\'fcn):\
    - K\'fct\'fcphane: Pytrends (Python; \'fccretsiz quota, rate limit var)\
    - Ya da resmi Google Trends API (Cloud, \'fccretli) \'97 Omer kullan\uc0\u305 c\u305  plan\u305  se\'e7er\
    - Cache stratejisi: keyword/tema bazl\uc0\u305 ; 24h TTL Redis veya Supabase summary_cache tablosunda\
    - Rate limit y\'f6netimi: kullan\uc0\u305 c\u305  ba\u351 \u305 na dakikada 5 sorgu; cache miss \u8594  quota da\u287 \u305 l\u305 m\u305 \
    - Fallback: API yan\uc0\u305 t vermezse "trend verisi \u351 u an al\u305 nam\u305 yor" + sadece akademik chart g\'f6sterilir (sayfa k\u305 r\u305 lmaz)\
\
(2) BACKEND \'97 etki e\uc0\u287 risi endpoint:\
    - GET /api/workshop/impact-curve?project_id=\{id\}&dimension=\{topic|method|keyword\}&value=\{id\}&years=\{5|10\}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) Akademik zaman serisi: papers JOIN (fact_paper_topic / fact_paper_metod / fact_paper_id_card.keywords) \uc0\u8594  y\u305 ll\u305 k COUNT\
      b) Google Trends: dimension+value'dan keyword string \'fcret \uc0\u8594  Pytrends.interest_over_time\
      c) \uc0\u9733  noktalar: project_pool \u8745  fact_paper_disruption WHERE cd_5 > config.disruption_threshold \u8594  pub_year listesi\
      d) \uc0\u9670  noktalar: project_pool \u8745  fact_paper_beauty WHERE b > config.beauty_threshold \u8594  (pub_year, pub_year + t_m) \'e7ift listesi\
      e) Momentum hesab\uc0\u305 : son 5 y\u305 l akademik slope + Trends slope linear regression \u8594  e\u351 ikle ye\u351 il/sar\u305 /k\u305 rm\u305 z\u305 \
      f) Gemini Flash \'e7a\uc0\u287 r\u305 : t\'fcm sinyaller \u8594  1 c\'fcmle yorum\
    - Output: \{ academic_series[], trends_series[], stars[], beauties[], momentum_color, llm_comment \}\
\
(3) FRONTEND:\
    - Recharts veya D3 ile \'e7ift line chart (sol y: paper say\uc0\u305 s\u305 , sa\u287  y: Trends ilgi 0-100)\
    - \'dcstte boyut se\'e7ici (3 radio: Konu / Kavram / Metod)\
    - Chart \'fcst\'fcne \uc0\u9733  ve \u9670  noktalar (tooltip)\
    - Sa\uc0\u287 da momentum rozet\
    - Altta LLM yorum\
    - Nokta t\uc0\u305 k \u8594  side panel Standart Yay\u305 n Kart\u305 \
\
(4) MOMENTUM E\uc0\u350 \u304 K KAL\u304 BRASYONU (V1 zorunlu, 4.1 + 4.4 kalibrasyon notebook'una eklenir):\
    - Akademik slope e\uc0\u351 ik:\
      * slope > +%5/y\uc0\u305 l \u8594  ye\u351 il\
      * -%5 ile +%5 aras\uc0\u305  \u8594  sar\u305 \
      * < -%5/y\uc0\u305 l \u8594  k\u305 rm\u305 z\u305 \
    - Trends slope e\uc0\u351 ik (0-100 normalize):\
      * slope > +5 puan/y\uc0\u305 l \u8594  ye\u351 il\
      * ... (taslak; kalibrasyonda ayarlan\uc0\u305 r)\
    - Kombine kural\uc0\u305 : akademik VE Trends ikisi ye\u351 il \u8594  ye\u351 il; biri k\u305 rm\u305 z\u305  \u8594  k\u305 rm\u305 z\u305 ; kar\u305 \u351 \u305 k \u8594  sar\u305 \
    - Tahmini ek i\uc0\u351 : 0.5 g\'fcn (mevcut kalibrasyon notebook'una eklenir)\
\
(5) LLM MAL\uc0\u304 YET TAHM\u304 N\u304 :\
    - Kombine yorum: ~3K input + ~100 output = ~$0.0005 per \'e7a\uc0\u287 r\u305 \
    - Boyut de\uc0\u287 i\u351 ti\u287 inde yeniden hesap; debounce 300ms\
    - Sayfa ba\uc0\u351 \u305 na ortalama 3-5 yorum \'fcretimi \u8594  ~$0.002\
\
(6) PERFORMANS HEDEF\uc0\u304 :\
    - Sayfa a\'e7\uc0\u305 l\u305 \u351 : < 1.2s (Google Trends API senkron olabilir; cache hit < 200ms)\
    - Boyut de\uc0\u287 i\u351 imi: < 500ms (academic SQL h\u305 zl\u305 ; Trends cache hit gerekiyorsa)\
    - Cache miss: ~800ms (Pytrends ger\'e7ek \'e7a\uc0\u287 r\u305 )\
\
